"Target: %(target)s kg/week. Actual trend: %(actual)s kg/week over the last "
"%(days)s days. Suggested adjustment: %(delta)+d kcal/day."
msgstr ""
"Eesmärk: %(target)s kg/nädal. Tegelik trend: %(actual)s kg/nädal viimase "
"%(days)s päeva jooksul. Soovitatud kohandus: %(delta)+d kcal/päevas."

#: apps/nutrition/views.py:434
