"Log a body weight measurement before changing your goal - the calorie target "
"needs your current weight."
msgstr ""
"Enne eesmärgi muutmist logi kehakaalu mõõtmine - kalorieesmärk vajab sinu "
"praegust kaalu."

#: apps/nutrition/views.py:471
