#: apps/programs/i18n_content.py:22
msgid "German Volume Training"
msgstr "Saksa mahutreening"

#: apps/programs/i18n_content.py:28
msgid ""
"A classic three-day full-body template: one squat/press/row day, one "
"deadlift/press/pull day, and one accessory-focused day. Copy it and adjust "
"weights/increments to your own."
msgstr ""
"Klassikaline kolmepäevane terve keha mall: kükk/surumine/sõudmine päev, "
"tõmme/surumine/tõmme päev ning abiharjutustele keskenduv päev. Kopeeri see "
"ja kohanda kaalusid/lisandusi enda järgi."

#: apps/programs/i18n_content.py:33
msgid ""
"The classic 6-day bodybuilding split popularized by Arnold Schwarzenegger in "
"the 1970s: chest/back, shoulders/arms, and legs, each trained twice a week. "
"Rotate through all three workouts, then repeat - not tied to fixed calendar "
"days."
msgstr ""
"Klassikaline 6-päevane kehaehituse jaotus, mille tegi 1970. aastatel "
"populaarseks Arnold Schwarzenegger: rind/selg, õlad/käed ja jalad, igaüks "
"trennis kaks korda nädalas. Vaheta kõiki kolme trenni ja korda - ei ole "
"seotud kindlate nädalapäevadega."

#: apps/programs/i18n_content.py:39
msgid ""
"A widely used 3-day split organized by movement pattern rather than body "
"part: pushing muscles, pulling muscles, then legs. Popular for both strength "
"and bodybuilding goals."
msgstr ""
"Laialt kasutatav 3-päevane jaotus, mis on korraldatud liikumismustri, mitte "
"kehaosa järgi: lükkavad lihased, tõmbavad lihased ja seejärel jalad. "
"Populaarne nii jõu- kui kehaehituse eesmärkidel."

#: apps/programs/i18n_content.py:44
msgid ""
"A classic beginner barbell strength program: two alternating full-body "
"workouts built around low-rep, high-set compound lifts with linear weight "
"progression each session."
msgstr ""
"Klassikaline algajate kangi jõuprogramm: kaks vahelduvat terve keha trenni, "
"mis on üles ehitatud väheste kordustega, paljude seeriatega "
"mitmeliigeselistele harjutustele koos lineaarse kaalu kasvuga igal korral."

#: apps/programs/i18n_content.py:49
msgid ""
"A 4-day split alternating upper-body and lower-body sessions twice each per "
"week - a common middle ground between full-body and single-muscle-group "
"routines, popular for balancing strength and volume without training every "
"day."
msgstr ""
"4-päevane jaotus, mis vahetab ülakeha ja alakeha trenne kaks korda nädalas "
"kumbagi - levinud kesktee terve keha ja üksiku lihasgrupi programmide vahel, "
"populaarne jõu ja mahu tasakaalustamiseks ilma iga päev trennis käimata."

#: apps/programs/i18n_content.py:55
msgid ""
"The classic 10x10 high-volume method: one main lift per workout done for ten "
"sets of ten reps at a fixed, moderate weight, paired with a lighter "
"accessory movement. Brutal on paper, simple in practice - built for muscle "
"growth, not 1-rep-max testing."
msgstr ""
"Klassikaline 10x10 suure mahu meetod: üks põhiharjutus trenni kohta, tehtud "
"kümne seeriaga kümme kordust fikseeritud mõõduka kaaluga, koos kergema "
"abiharjutusega. Paberil brutaalne, praktikas lihtne - loodud lihaskasvuks, "
"mitte 1RM testimiseks."

