msgstr "Sõbrad ja grupid"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:118 templates/base.html:179 templates/base.html:181
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Avaleht"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:123 templates/accounts/_onboarding_modal.html:5
#: templates/accounts/_onboarding_modal.html:7
msgid "Welcome to IronStack"
msgstr "Tere tulemast IronStacki"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:125
msgid ""
"A quick look around. Every section has a short tour like this the first time "
"you open it - skip any of them, or turn them all off."
msgstr ""
"Kiire ringkäik. Igal jaotisel on samasugune lühike tutvustus, kui selle "
"esimest korda avad - jäta ükskõik milline vahele või lülita kõik välja."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:131
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigeerimine"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:133
msgid ""
"Everything is one tap away from here: home, nutrition and stretching (if you "
"use them), progress, workouts, programs and your profile."
msgstr ""
"Kõik on siit ühe puudutuse kaugusel: avaleht, toitumine ja venitamine (kui "
"neid kasutad), areng, treeningud, kavad ja sinu profiil."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:139
msgid "Your workout"
msgstr "Sinu treening"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:141
msgid ""
"Start a workout here, or jump back into the one you're in the middle of. "
"Once you've trained from a program, its next workout is offered here."
msgstr ""
"Alusta siit treeningut või jätka pooleliolevat. Kui oled mõne programmi "
"järgi treeninud, pakutakse siin selle järgmist treeningut."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:147 templates/core/dashboard.html:91
msgid "Shopping day"
msgstr "Poepäev"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:148
msgid "On your shopping days, your list for the trip is one tap away here."
msgstr ""
"Poepäevadel on selle poeskäigu ostunimekiri siin ühe puudutuse kaugusel."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:153 templates/core/dashboard.html:111
msgid "Achievements"
msgstr "Saavutused"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:154
msgid "Streaks and milestones from everyone on this server who shares them."
msgstr ""
"Seeriad ja verstapostid kõigilt selle serveri kasutajatelt, kes neid jagavad."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:159 templates/base.html:252
msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr "Otseteed"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:160
msgid "The exercise library, body tracking, activities and stretching."
msgstr "Harjutuste kogu, keha jälgimine, tegevused ja venitamine."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:164
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "Kalender"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:166
msgid ""
"Each day's training and nutrition at a glance. Tap a day for details; the "
"“?” explains the colours."
msgstr ""
"Iga päeva treening ja toitumine ühe pilguga. Puuduta päeva üksikasjade "
"nägemiseks; „?” selgitab värve."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:173
msgid "Your profile"
msgstr "Sinu profiil"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:175
msgid ""
"Preferences, friends, your data - and Tutorials, where you can replay any of "
"these tours."
msgstr ""
"Eelistused, sõbrad, sinu andmed - ja Tutvustused, kust saad ükskõik millise "
"neist ringkäikudest uuesti vaadata."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:185 templates/workouts/session_list.html:3
msgid "Workout history"
msgstr "Trennide ajalugu"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:190
msgid "Your workouts"
msgstr "Sinu treeningud"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:191
msgid "Every workout you've done, newest first. Open one to see or correct it."
msgstr ""
"Kõik sinu treeningud, uusimad eespool. Ava treening, et seda vaadata või "
"parandada."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:196
msgid "Start without a plan"
msgstr "Alusta ilma kavata"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:198
msgid ""
"A freeform workout lets you add any exercises as you go. Workouts from a "
"program start from the program's page."
msgstr ""
"Vabas treeningus lisad harjutusi jooksvalt. Kava treeningud alustatakse kava "
"lehelt."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:207
msgid "Logging a workout"
msgstr "Treeningu logimine"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:213
msgid "This workout"
msgstr "See treening"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:214
msgid ""
"When it started and ended, and how many sets and how much volume so far."
msgstr "Millal see algas ja lõppes ning kui palju seeriaid ja mahtu seni."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:218
msgid "One card per exercise"
msgstr "Üks kaart iga harjutuse kohta"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:219
msgid ""
"The sets you've logged appear here, and you can edit or delete any of them."
msgstr ""
"Logitud seeriad on siin ja saad ükskõik millist neist muuta või kustutada."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:224 apps/tutorials/tours.py:307
#: templates/stretching/stretch_detail.html:30
msgid "How to do it"
msgstr "Kuidas teha"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:226 apps/tutorials/tours.py:309
msgid ""
"Tap i to see the exercise's instructions and images without leaving your "
"workout."
msgstr ""
"Puuduta i-nuppu, et näha harjutuse juhiseid ja pilte trennist lahkumata."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:233 apps/tutorials/tours.py:316
msgid "Suggested weight"
msgstr "Soovitatud raskus"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:235
msgid ""
"Based on your last sessions, with the reason and how confident it is. It's "
"only a starting point - you decide what goes on the bar."
msgstr ""
"Põhineb sinu viimastel treeningutel, koos põhjenduse ja kindlusastmega. See "
"on vaid lähtepunkt - sina otsustad, mis kangile läheb."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:242
msgid "Log a set"
msgstr "Logi seeria"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:244
msgid ""
"Enter weight and reps and tap Log set. RPE, RIR, warm-up and failure are "
"optional. New personal records are detected automatically."
msgstr ""
"Sisesta raskus ja kordused ning puuduta Logi seeria. RPE, RIR, soojendus ja "
"läbikukkumine on valikulised. Uued isiklikud rekordid tuvastatakse "
"automaatselt."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:251
msgid "Add an exercise"
msgstr "Lisa harjutus"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:252
msgid "Add anything that isn't in the plan - it only changes this workout."
msgstr "Lisa kõike, mida kavas pole - see muudab ainult seda treeningut."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:257 apps/tutorials/tours.py:278
msgid "Training mode"
msgstr "Treeningurežiim"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:259
msgid ""
"One exercise at a time with big buttons and a rest timer - the easiest way "
"to log at the gym. This button follows you on every page."
msgstr ""
"Üks harjutus korraga, suured nupud ja puhkeaja taimer - lihtsaim viis "
"jõusaalis logida. See nupp liigub sinuga igal lehel kaasas."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:266 apps/tutorials/tours.py:1056
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "Lõpeta"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:268
msgid ""
"Complete the workout when you're done. Abandon keeps it in your history as "
"unfinished."
msgstr ""
"Märgi treening lõpetatuks, kui oled valmis. Katkestatud treening jääb "
"ajalukku lõpetamata kujul."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:286
msgid ""
"The dots show your progress. The arrows move between exercises in any order "
"- the next unfinished one opens by default."
msgstr ""
"Täpid näitavad sinu edenemist. Nooltega liigud harjutuste vahel mis tahes "
"järjekorras - vaikimisi avaneb järgmine lõpetamata harjutus."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:292 templates/workouts/_train_panel.html:28
msgid "Time left"
msgstr "Aega jäänud"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:294
msgid ""
"Roughly how long the sets you haven't logged yet will take, from how long "
"sets usually take here. The ± covers the typical spread."
msgstr ""
"Umbes kui kaua sinu veel logimata seeriad aega võtavad, selle põhjal, kui "
"kaua seeriad siin tavaliselt kestavad. ± näitab tavalist kõikumist."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:301
msgid "Current exercise"
msgstr "Praegune harjutus"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:302
msgid "Its target and the sets you've already logged; tap a set to edit it."
msgstr ""
"Selle eesmärk ja juba logitud seeriad; puuduta seeriat selle muutmiseks."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:317
msgid ""
"A starting point from your history. You can always enter something else."
msgstr "Lähtepunkt sinu ajaloost. Saad alati sisestada midagi muud."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:322
msgid "Log the set"
msgstr "Logi seeria"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:324
msgid ""
"Weight and reps, then Log set. “More options” has RPE, RIR, warm-up, failure "
"and notes."
msgstr ""
"Raskus ja kordused, siis Logi seeria. „Rohkem valikuid” sisaldab RPE-d, RIR-"
"i, soojendust, läbikukkumist ja märkmeid."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:331 templates/workouts/session_train.html:26
msgid "Rest timer"
msgstr "Puhkeajastin"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:333
msgid ""
"Starts by itself after each set and chimes when rest is over. Adjust it by "
"15 seconds, skip it, or mute the sound."
msgstr ""
"Käivitub iga seeria järel ise ja helistab, kui puhkus on läbi. Muuda seda 15 "
"sekundi kaupa, jäta vahele või lülita heli välja."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:339 templates/workouts/session_train.html:9
msgid "Full view"
msgstr "Täisvaade"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:340
msgid "Every exercise at once - for reviewing or correcting the whole workout."
msgstr ""
"Kõik harjutused korraga - kogu treeningu ülevaatamiseks või parandamiseks."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:353
msgid "Create or import"
msgstr "Loo või impordi"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:354
msgid "Build your own program, or import one someone exported for you."
msgstr "Koosta oma kava või impordi kava, mille keegi sulle eksportis."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:358
msgid "Your programs"
msgstr "Sinu kavad"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:359
msgid "Open a program to see its workouts and start one."
msgstr "Ava kava, et näha selle treeninguid ja alustada üht neist."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:364
msgid "Ready-made programs"
msgstr "Valmiskavad"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:366
msgid ""
"Copy a built-in program to make it yours. Changing your copy never changes "
"workouts you've already logged."
msgstr ""
"Kopeeri sisseehitatud kava endale. Koopia muutmine ei muuda kunagi juba "
"logitud treeninguid."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:376
msgid "A program"
msgstr "Kava"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:382
msgid "About the program"
msgstr "Kavast"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:384
msgid ""
"Its description and version. Editing a program never changes workouts you've "
"already logged."
msgstr ""
"Selle kirjeldus ja versioon. Kava muutmine ei muuda kunagi juba logitud "
"treeninguid."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:390 apps/tutorials/tours.py:1027
msgid "Make it yours"
msgstr "Tee see enda omaks"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:391
msgid ""
"This is a template: copy it to a program of your own to edit and use it."
msgstr ""
"See on mall: kopeeri see oma kavaks, et saaksid seda muuta ja kasutada."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:398
msgid ""
"A program is a set of workouts, each with its exercises, sets, reps and how "
"the weight should progress."
msgstr ""
"Kava koosneb treeningutest, millest igaühel on oma harjutused, seeriad, "
"kordused ja raskuse tõstmise viis."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:405
msgid "How long it takes"
msgstr "Kui kaua see kestab"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:407
msgid ""
"Estimated from how long sets of these exercises have taken in logged "
"workouts - the more you log, the closer it gets."
msgstr ""
"Hinnatud selle põhjal, kui kaua nende harjutuste seeriad on logitud "
"treeningutes kestnud - mida rohkem logid, seda täpsem see on."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:414 templates/core/dashboard.html:36
#: templates/programs/program_detail.html:50
msgid "Up next"
msgstr "Järgmisena"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:416
msgid ""
"The workout that's next: today's or the next scheduled day's, or in a "
"continuous program the one after the last you finished."
msgstr ""
"Järgmine treening: tänane või järgmise planeeritud päeva oma, või "
"järjestikuses programmis see, mis tuleb pärast viimati tehtut."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:423
msgid "Add exercises"
msgstr "Lisa harjutusi"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:424
msgid "Add an exercise to a workout and set its target sets and reps."
msgstr "Lisa treeningule harjutus ja määra selle eesmärkseeriad ja -kordused."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:429
msgid "Start it"
msgstr "Alusta"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:430
msgid "Starts a workout with these exercises and targets filled in."
msgstr "Alustab treeningut, kus need harjutused ja eesmärgid on juba täidetud."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:435
msgid "Add a workout"
msgstr "Lisa treening"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:436
msgid "For example a second training day."
msgstr "Näiteks teine treeningpäev."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:444
msgid "Exercise library"
msgstr "Harjutuste kogu"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:449
msgid "Find an exercise"
msgstr "Leia harjutus"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:450
msgid "Search by name, or filter by muscle group and equipment."
msgstr "Otsi nime järgi või filtreeri lihasgrupi ja varustuse järgi."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:454
msgid "Your own exercises"
msgstr "Sinu harjutused"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:455
msgid "Missing something? Add it - only you will see it."
msgstr "Midagi puudu? Lisa see - ainult sina näed seda."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:462
msgid "An exercise"
msgstr "Harjutus"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:468 templates/workouts/_exercise_set_cycle.html:3
msgid "Set cycle"
msgstr "Seeriatsükkel"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:470
msgid ""
"How long it usually takes from one set to the next, rest included - yours, "
"and everyone's when others log it too."
msgstr ""
"Kui kaua tavaliselt ühest seeriast järgmiseni kulub, puhkus kaasa arvatud - "
"sinu oma ja kõigi oma, kui ka teised seda logivad."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:478
msgid "Your best lifts for this exercise, kept up to date automatically."
msgstr "Sinu parimad tõsted selles harjutuses, uuenevad automaatselt."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:483
msgid "Your estimated one-rep max and volume for this exercise over time."
msgstr ""
"Sinu hinnanguline ühe korduse maksimum ja maht selles harjutuses aja jooksul."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:496 apps/tutorials/tours.py:533
msgid "Time range"
msgstr "Ajavahemik"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:497
msgid "Everything on this page follows the range you pick here."
msgstr "Kõik sellel lehel järgib siin valitud ajavahemikku."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:501
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Kokkuvõte"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:502
msgid "Workouts, time spent training and total volume lifted in the range."
msgstr ""
"Treeningud, treeningule kulunud aeg ja kogu tõstetud maht valitud "
"ajavahemikus."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:506
msgid "One exercise"
msgstr "Üks harjutus"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:507
msgid "Pick an exercise to see how its strength has developed."
msgstr "Vali harjutus, et näha, kuidas selle jõud on arenenud."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:512
msgid "Weekly volume"
msgstr "Nädala maht"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:513
msgid ""
"How much you lifted each week. The table under the chart has exact figures."
msgstr ""
"Kui palju sa igal nädalal tõstsid. Diagrammi all olevas tabelis on täpsed "
"arvud."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:518
msgid "Muscle groups"
msgstr "Lihasgrupid"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:519
msgid "Which muscles got the most work - handy for spotting imbalances."
msgstr ""
"Millised lihased said kõige rohkem tööd - kasulik tasakaalutuse märkamiseks."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:527
msgid "Progress for an exercise"
msgstr "Harjutuse areng"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:534
msgid "Choose how far back to look."
msgstr "Vali, kui kaugele tagasi vaadata."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:540
msgid ""
"The heaviest single rep you could likely lift, estimated from your sets. A "
"rising line means you're getting stronger."
msgstr ""
"Raskeim üksikkordus, mida tõenäoliselt suudaksid, hinnatud sinu seeriate "
"põhjal. Tõusev joon tähendab, et muutud tugevamaks."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:556
msgid "Current records"
msgstr "Praegused rekordid"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:557
msgid "Heaviest weight, best estimated 1RM, most reps and more."
msgstr "Raskeim raskus, parim hinnanguline 1RM, enim kordusi ja muud."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:561 templates/records/exercise_records.html:28
msgid "Rep maxes"
msgstr "Korduste maksimumid"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:562
msgid "The most weight you've lifted for each number of reps."
msgstr "Suurim raskus, mida oled iga korduste arvuga tõstnud."

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:570 templates/core/dashboard.html:173
#: templates/measurements/measurement_history.html:5
#: templates/measurements/measurement_type_list.html:3
#: templates/measurements/measurement_type_list.html:6
msgid "Body tracking"
msgstr "Keha jälgimine"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:575
msgid "What you track"
msgstr "Mida jälgid"

#: apps/tutorials/tours.py:576
msgid "Body weight, waist, body fat and more. Open one to log a reading."
msgstr "Kehakaal, vöökoht, keharasv ja muu. Ava üks näidu logimiseks."

