#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:30
msgid ""
"IronStack is self-hosted, open-source software - the person or organization "
"running this particular installation (not the software's authors) is who's "
"responsible for the data on it, and who you should contact about any of the "
"below."
msgstr ""
"IronStack on iseseisvalt majutatav avatud lähtekoodiga tarkvara - selle "
"konkreetse paigalduse käitaja (mitte tarkvara autorid) vastutab sellel "
"olevate andmete eest ja on see, kellega peaksid ühendust võtma mis tahes "
"allpool oleva küsimuse korral."

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:31
msgid "Contact:"
msgstr "Kontakt:"

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:32
msgid "What's collected"
msgstr "Mida kogutakse"

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:33
msgid ""
"Your account details (username, and optionally your name and email address), "
"and whatever you choose to log: workout history, body measurements, "
"nutrition and diet data, and other activities. Technical data such as your "
"IP address is used briefly for rate-limiting and security (e.g. blocking "
"repeated failed login attempts), not stored as part of your account."
msgstr ""
"Sinu konto andmed (kasutajanimi ja soovi korral sinu nimi ja e-posti "
"aadress) ning kõik, mida otsustad logida: treeningajalugu, kehamõõdud, "
"toitumis- ja dieediandmed ning muud tegevused. Tehnilisi andmeid, näiteks "
"sinu IP-aadressi, kasutatakse lühiajaliselt kiiruse piiramiseks ja "
"turvalisuseks (nt korduvate ebaõnnestunud sisselogimiskatsete "
"blokeerimiseks) ning neid ei salvestata sinu konto osana."

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:34
msgid "Why"
msgstr "Miks"

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:35
msgid ""
"Solely to provide the tracking features you're using - nothing here is "
"shared with, sold to, or processed by any third party, except the few "
"optional integrations you have to explicitly turn on yourself (e.g. an "
"OpenFoodFacts lookup, a Gravatar picture, Authentik single sign-on)."
msgstr ""
"Ainult selleks, et pakkuda jälgimisfunktsioone, mida kasutad - mitte midagi "
"sellest ei jagata, müüda ega töödelda ühegi kolmanda osapoole poolt, välja "
"arvatud üksikud valikulised integratsioonid, mille pead ise sisse lülitama "
"(nt OpenFoodFacts otsing, Gravatari pilt, Authentiku ühekordne "
"sisselogimine)."

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:36
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr "Sinu õigused"

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:38
msgid ""
"Access and rectification - everything you've logged is visible and editable "
"directly in the app."
msgstr ""
"Ligipääs ja parandamine - kõik, mida oled logind, on nähtav ja muudetav otse "
"rakenduses."

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:39
msgid ""
"Erasure - Profile → \"Delete account\" permanently deletes your account and "
"everything exclusively tied to it."
msgstr ""
"Kustutamine - Profiil → \"Kustuta konto\" kustutab jäädavalt sinu konto ja "
"kõik, mis on ainult sellega seotud."

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:40
msgid ""
"Portability - the public API (Profile → \"API keys\") can export your own "
"data in a structured format."
msgstr ""
"Ülekantavus - avalik API (Profiil → \"API võtmed\") saab eksportida sinu "
"enda andmed struktureeritud kujul."

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:42
msgid "Retention"
msgstr "Säilitamine"

#: templates/accounts/_privacy_notice_modal.html:43
msgid ""
"Kept for as long as your account exists. A backup made before you delete "
"anything may still contain it until that backup itself is rotated out - see "
"the account deletion page for details."
msgstr ""
"Säilitatakse seni, kuni sinu konto on olemas. Enne kustutamist tehtud "
"varukoopia võib andmeid ikka sisaldada, kuni see varukoopia ise eemaldatakse "
"- vaata täpsemalt konto kustutamise lehelt."

#: templates/accounts/_two_factor_backup_codes_fragment.html:4
msgid ""
"Each one works once, if you ever lose access to your authenticator app. They "
"won't be shown again - save them somewhere safe now. Your old backup codes "
"no longer work."
msgstr ""
"Iga kood töötab üks kord, kui kaotad juurdepääsu oma autentimisrakendusele. "
"Neid enam uuesti ei näidata - salvesta need nüüd turvalisse kohta. Sinu "
"vanad varukoodid enam ei kehti."

#: templates/accounts/account_delete.html:3
#: templates/accounts/account_delete.html:6 templates/accounts/profile.html:253
msgid "Delete account"
msgstr "Kustuta konto"

#: templates/accounts/account_delete.html:10
msgid ""
"This permanently deletes your account and everything tied to it: your "
"profile, workout history, personal records, body measurements, nutrition "
"diary and targets, diet plans, activities, feedback, and API keys. This "
"can't be undone."
msgstr ""
"See kustutab jäädavalt sinu konto ja kõik sellega seotu: profiili, "
"treeningajaloo, isiklikud rekordid, kehamõõdud, toitumispäeviku ja "
"eesmärgid, dieedikavad, tegevused, tagasiside ja API-võtmed. Seda ei saa "
"tagasi võtta."

#: templates/accounts/account_delete.html:11
msgid ""
"A custom exercise, food, recipe, program, or measurement/activity type you "
"created is kept, not deleted, if anyone else on this instance is already "
"using it - it's just no longer credited to your account."
msgstr ""
"Sinu loodud kohandatud harjutus, toit, retsept, programm või mõõtmis-/"
"tegevustüüp säilitatakse, mitte ei kustutata, kui keegi teine sellel "
"paigaldusel seda juba kasutab - see lihtsalt ei ole enam sinu kontoga seotud."

#: templates/accounts/account_delete.html:12
msgid ""
"A backup made before you deleted your account may still contain your data "
"until it's rotated out by this instance's own backup retention setting."
msgstr ""
"Enne konto kustutamist tehtud varukoopia võib sinu andmeid ikka sisaldada, "
"kuni see eemaldatakse selle paigalduse enda varukoopiate säilitusseadistuse "
"järgi."

#: templates/accounts/account_delete.html:21
msgid ""
"Your account is linked to Authentik, so there's no local password to confirm "
"with - type your username instead."
msgstr ""
"Sinu konto on seotud Authentikuga, seega kohalikku parooli kinnitamiseks ei "
"ole - sisesta selle asemel oma kasutajanimi."

#: templates/accounts/account_delete.html:24
msgid "Permanently delete my account"
msgstr "Kustuta minu konto jäädavalt"

