#: templates/assistant/_consent_notice.html:11
msgid ""
"Your messages, and the training and nutrition data the assistant looks up to "
"answer them, are sent to Anthropic (the maker of Claude) to generate replies."
msgstr ""
"Sinu sõnumid ning treening- ja toitumisandmed, mida assistent vastamiseks "
"vaatab, saadetakse vastuste koostamiseks Anthropicule (Claude'i looja)."

#: templates/assistant/_consent_notice.html:13
msgid ""
"It only reads your own data, and only while it's answering you. It can't "
"change anything: plans it suggests are created only if you choose to."
msgstr ""
"See loeb ainult sinu enda andmeid ja ainult siis, kui sulle vastab. See ei "
"saa midagi muuta: soovitatud kavad luuakse ainult siis, kui ise nii otsustad."

#: templates/assistant/_consent_notice.html:14
