"You choose what it may read - body measurements, food diary and more - on "
"its settings page."
msgstr ""
"Sina valid selle seadetes, mida see tohib lugeda - kehamõõdud, toidupäevik "
"ja muu."

#: templates/assistant/_consent_notice.html:15
